<title>UK: Merrill sets warrants on EMS-Chemie.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets warrants on EMS-Chemie.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG said it has issued five million American-style call warrants on bearer shares of EMS-Chemie Holding AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 200 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    6,300 CHF		 PREMIUM	12.07 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.50 CHF		  GEARING	12.59 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 14.MAY.97-17.APR.98   PAYDATE	09.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 200</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  6,050 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
